<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <style>
      body { color: #20252b; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; }
      p { margin: 12px 0; }
      .code { font-family: monospace; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; margin: 20px 0; }
      table { border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
      th, td { padding: 4px 16px 4px 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
      td { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
      .footer { color: #59636e; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 24px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Hi <%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@user.login) %>,</p>
    <p>To finish signing in to vpsAdmin from an unknown device, please use this verification code:</p>
    <p class="code"><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@code) %></p>
    <p>The code expires at <%= ERB::Util.html_escape(local_time(@expires_at)) %>. It is valid for 30 minutes from the initial request.</p>
    <table>
      <tr><th scope="row">Service:</th><td><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@service_name) %></td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Date and time:</th><td><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(local_time(@requested_at, '%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S %Z')) %></td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Device:</th><td><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@device) %></td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">IP address:</th><td><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@ip_address) %></td></tr>
      <tr><th scope="row">Reverse record:</th><td><%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@ip_ptr) %></td></tr>
    </table>
    <p>If you did not try to sign in, someone may know your password. Please change it from a known device or contact <%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@support_mail) %>.</p>
    <p>Best regards,<br>vpsAdmin team</p>
    <p class="footer">
      (This is an automated mail from vpsAdmin, your reply will be sent to our support)
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
